-- title:
--   Transcendence of j and finiteness of K over L(j)
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ and $\ell$ be primes, $M'$ a nonzero natural number, and $L$ any field of characteristic zero. Let $K$ be an intermediate field of $L \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ which is assumed equal to [`ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange L`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L103) applied to [`ModularCurve.xHFunctionField ((q*ℓ)^2*M') (ModularCurve.FullLevel.levelH (q*ℓ) M')`](def/ModularCurve_XH.html#L79); that is, $K$ is the $L$-subfield of $L(\!(X)\!)$ generated by the coefficientwise images, under the ring map [`ModularCurve.coeffEmb L`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L81) induced by $\mathbb{Q} \to L$ on Laurent coefficients, of the rational $q$-expansion function field `qExpFunctionFieldC ℚ (CohCarrier.GammaH ((q*ℓ)^2*M') H)` attached to the subgroup $H \le (\mathbb{Z}/(q\ell)^2M')^{\times}$ given by the kernel of the reduction map to $(\mathbb{Z}/q\ell)^{\times}$. Let $A$ be a commutative domain with an algebra structure on $L$ making $L$ a fraction field of $A$, together with an $A$-algebra structure on $K$ compatible with that of $L$ via a scalar tower. Finally let $j \in K$ be an element whose image in $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ is `coeffEmb L jq`, the coefficientwise image of the rational $q$-expansion $X^{-1}\cdot j_{\mathrm{num}}$. The conclusion is threefold: $j$ is transcendental over $A$; $K$ is finite-dimensional over the intermediate field $L(j) =$ `IntermediateField.adjoin L {j}`; and $K$ is separable over $L(j)$.
--
--   This packages, for arbitrary base field $L$ of characteristic zero, the standard facts that the $q$-expansion $j(q) = q^{-1} + 744 + \cdots$ is transcendental and that the function field of the modular curve of the given level is a finite separable extension of the rational field it generates. The three conclusions are precisely the hypotheses required by the Drinfeld-chart and blow-up-chart constructions at level $(q\ell)^2M'$ that cite it.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_AuxLevel_transcendental_and_finiteDimensional_and_isSeparable_adjoin_of_coe_eq_coeffEmb_jq_of_charZero.lean

